# Sensitive automation and release controls. Do not cover iocs/**: the
# scheduled refresh workflow is deliberately allowed to auto-merge bounded,
# IOC-only changes after CI succeeds.
#
# Advisory: a review checklist, not a gate. GitHub cannot require review for
# specific paths alone — require_code_owner_review has no effect unless
# required_approving_review_count is at least 1, and that count applies to every
# pull request to the default branch, which would block the IOC refresh and
# Dependabot auto-merges. Enforcing needs a second reviewing account plus bypass
# actors for the merging bots.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @noeljackson
/.github/workflows/** @noeljackson
/.github/actions/** @noeljackson
/.supplychain/** @noeljackson
/.gitleaks.toml @noeljackson
/.goreleaser.y*ml @noeljackson
/action.yml @noeljackson
/scripts/install-ci-tools @noeljackson
/scripts/setup-go @noeljackson
